steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.poster.avif?t=1778289358\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.webm?t=1778289358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/d0753888154eb3eaf40b319e6dea9693.mp4?t=1778289358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Adventure Begins </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure tests your mettle in three different enemy regions, offering a unique experience with every campaign. Choose your path through enemy territory wisely, selecting between many challenging encounters with different rewards on your way to the final clash with an enemy Champion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy encounters to collect money, keys and new cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special battle conditions to earn promotion gems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-bosses to collect relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stores to buy and trade resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taverns to collect missions with greater rewards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal anomalies that lead to distant regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortcuts unlocked by bribing the locals </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.poster.avif?t=1778289358\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.webm?t=1778289358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/extras/9fa9d4ab939df291b3d29b1368d49d33.mp4?t=1778289358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dragon Front: Adventures </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 regions/factions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unique units and 15 spells per region</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique champions per region – each with legendary abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 mini-bosses per region</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 battle mutators per region</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 general supply cards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ relics </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Front: Adventures is currently being developed.</p>", "short_description": "A single player card battler without limits: every hand playable, every battle unique. Where champions grow their armies through promotion and the spoils of battle. With no mana system to hold you back, success depends on how you place your forces and outthink your enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/9a8be01a78123b9e2a5fb779692ae469c7fb664e/header.jpg?t=1778289358", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/26f061a9c4da1653125767d638b0a39f26b02f7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778289358", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952180/26f061a9c4da1653125767d638b0a39f26b02f7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778289358", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</stro